From: W1700K port <w1700k@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] mt76: npu: trace PPE unbind hits on WLAN RX

Temporary trace to confirm whether WLAN RX (STA->AP) frames are punted
to the CPU with the HIT_UNBIND reason after a STA disconnect/reconnect.

Signed-off-by: W1700K port <w1700k@localhost>
---
 npu.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

--- a/npu.c	2026-08-20 19:45:00.085599258 +0800
+++ b/npu.c	2026-08-20 19:45:00.093109460 +0800
@@ -134,6 +134,8 @@
 	reason = FIELD_GET(NPU_RX_DMA_CRSN_MASK, info);
 	if (reason == PPE_CPU_REASON_HIT_UNBIND_RATE_REACHED) {
 		skb_set_mac_header(skb, 0);
+		pr_debug_ratelimited("mt76_npu: ppe unbind hit hash=%04x dev=%s\n",
+				     hash, skb->dev ? skb->dev->name : "none");
 		airoha_ppe_dev_check_skb(ppe_dev, skb, hash, true);
 	}
 out:
